{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":273916,\"title\":\"Beyond Bob\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Isaac is in love with his old college friend, Tracy, who is about to marry the wrong man. Isaac is prepared to passively accept this marriage until he nudged into action by Tracy's old boyfriend, Bob...who has been dead for ten years.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fFdDusdTNJJy04DY3IolA4FJUOn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wHUAi2IuewQfMIIMVdcvIqQ8fmK.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":1995,\"runtime\":100,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"John Gaspard\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2342505,\"name\":\"John Gaspard\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4272702,\"name\":\"Patrick Coyle\",\"character\":\"Isaac\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1660536,\"name\":\"Michael Paul Levin\",\"character\":\"Bob\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4272703,\"name\":\"Leslie Ball\",\"character\":\"Tracy\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":156108,\"name\":\"Peter Moore\",\"character\":\"Neal\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8rbVoZIl7n7JM8eiCI5gXFGXu7x.jpg\"},{\"id\":4272705,\"name\":\"Kathryn O'Malley\",\"character\":\"Ginny\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4272706,\"name\":\"Julie Briskman-Hall\",\"character\":\"Kris\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4272707,\"name\":\"Dan Rowles\",\"character\":\"Augie\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2009669,\"name\":\"Paul R. Smith\",\"character\":\"Pops\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4272722,\"name\":\"Richard Gibbons\",\"character\":\"Minister\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3493475,\"name\":\"Eve Black\",\"character\":\"Bar Waitress\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4272723,\"name\":\"Jon Schumacher\",\"character\":\"Bar Geek\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4272724,\"name\":\"Amelia Barnes\",\"character\":\"Older Sister\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4272725,\"name\":\"Adam Goldberg\",\"character\":\"Younger Brother\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4272728,\"name\":\"Steve Gronwall\",\"character\":\"Head Biker\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4272729,\"name\":\"Jayme Lee Misfeldt\",\"character\":\"Bar Woman\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":12556,\"title\":\"Ghosts of Girlfriends Past\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/azzg0lv5vpQRoOrZfNVkJn04f1M.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9kQqsHqUlx7FB1Ttf5DdH03aqP7.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Celebrity photographer Connor Mead lives life in the fast lane, committed to lifelong bachelorhood and simultaneous relationships with multiple women. On the eve of his younger brother Paul's wedding, Connor's mockery of love proves a real buzz-kill for everyone - including his childhood crush, Jenny, the one woman who always seemed immune to his considerable charms. Later that night, he gets a wake-up call from the ghost of his late Uncle Wayne, the hard-partying, legendary ladies' man who was Connor's mentor. Uncle Wayne has an urgent message which he delivers through three ghosts who guide Connor on an eye-opening tour of his romantic past, present and future. Along the way, they attempt to discern whether he will ever be able to change his ways -- and if there is any hope of him finding true love.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":219,\"title\":\"Volver\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ljRPzuI1xybiFUGU1uCRdx68h0K.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cLvcOx8RbSUPCbkynKzNIg1zc2g.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three generations of women deal with family secrets while surviving the east wind, fire, insanity, superstition, lies and even death.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":644831,\"title\":\"Blithe Spirit\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/phX4R5hjaavV2w1EcMXCtL5uDP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qwBhq38RDycERnJUmMKiaLiQxUt.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A spiritualist medium holds a seance for a writer suffering from writers block but accidentally summons the spirit of his deceased first wife which leads to an increasingly complex love triangle with his current wife of five years.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":52060,\"title\":\"Christmas Cupid\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ldW5GWiktjjakPa8yZWnCK8Z0Dz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5xN3McEMUVJredTSr9Jc8pXKJO1.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sloan is beautiful, stylish, and on the fast track to success at her public relations firm. After her client Caitlin ends up in a coma and becomes her own personal ghost of Christmas past, present, and future; she finds out first hand that her unethical ways needs to change and reuniting with a past jilted lover may be the answer.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":326333,\"title\":\"Liza, the Fox-Fairy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h0nP7HDejKeuiJumJpR5S5GOnG1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3pNf4EyNet3WNHRpxtQrsUlZeEf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Liza is a naïve, lonely 30-year-old nurse who wants to fall in love. Her only company is a long-dead Japanese pop star, who turns her into a fox-fairy out of jealousy. Now, every man who desires Liza shall die horribly. Can she overcome the curse?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":458339,\"title\":\"Haunted Inc.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p6EjoVKNze1b73ba2uNMIBbBghP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":10,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two down-on-their-luck roommates looking for an easy way to pay the rent answer an unusual ad in a local paper and scare up more than just money.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1049581,\"title\":\"Polterguest\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nKQXNwjFMl8WIDC3kXlckwvDVYD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fpwh5zox8fck9Qkqtn3EVJ44n3A.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Halloween enthusiasts JESS and ZACH BRYER move into their new home, they focus their attention on transforming it into a spectacular haunted house as per their family tradition. As they continue to move in, Jess begins to notice odd disturbances regarding a family photo that came with the house. This culminates in the revelation that a pair of ghosts, ROBERT and MARGE occupy the residence. Though the ghosts clearly dislike the new occupants, Jess and Zach take this as a good omen. Jess and Zach beg the ghosts to help haunt their haunted house to which Robert and Marge take even more offense, and refuse the offer. Through trial and error, the humans attempt to scare the ghosts into helping them, though nothing works. At her breaking point, Jess destroys the ghost's picture frame, leading them into a fit of rage in which they resort to their supernatural powers. Impressed by their abilities, the humans flatter the ghosts into working with them, and the haunted house is a success.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1232976,\"title\":\"Faati Ne?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9fgnfbGGJLRAaJMKoiD7qHoaqwt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gURVd4ZYN9sHzxKFRziVW4Nb8im.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two dimwit cops must survive the most terrifying night of their lives to win the things that matter most.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10756,\"title\":\"The Haunted Mansion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lGi5yio4pdDz5PkSeZCbnMQz5vK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uUgn9P3Ulmjt9bOfp5Yt83fauAS.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Workaholic Jim Evers and his wife/business partner Sara get a call one night from  a mansion owner, Edward Gracey, who wants to sell his house. Once the Evers family arrive at the mansion, a torrential thunderstorm of mysterious origin strands them with the brooding, eccentric Gracey, his mysterious butler, and a variety of residents both seen and unseen.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1443176,\"title\":\"After Life Crisis\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pt691JzMEo04IEuIABLypwZOLp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qes0XDIsmAyOprY9PNFPmA9ljPi.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ben Whitfield, a successful Scare Artist (ghost), has lost his passion and sense of purpose. As his friends and co-workers try to help keep him on track, his desire to shake things up and live his After Life on his own terms threatens to destroy the whole team.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":272298,\"title\":\"Icharus Broken\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oV1MrILRgdU2bGR3z8AatYmBpf6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AepbEELtoF06PgOpXOsdcPBvuo.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After four years in prison, Bobby is released into a world he no longer recognizes. His exgirlfriend Penny is abusing drugs. Their daughter is in foster care. Bobby's sister is in the process of rebuilding her life after a bad relationship.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":460456,\"title\":\"Andhhagadu\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wC6s9HxxZUZs4iFvVFd8OcpaMyJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aVT6HfMiDq6XIT4xnDnxdRKzVdh.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A blind man falls in love with the doctor who has arranged his eye transplant. The operation, although successful, carries unexpected and haunting consequences.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Comedy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"FvJR21j8EHE\",\"name\":\"Beyond Bob (Trailer 2022)\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}